    $$ PCC = \frac{\sum_{i=1}^{N} (MOS_i - \overline{MOS})(MOS_{p,i} - \overline{MOS_p})}{\sqrt{\sum_{i=1}^{N} (MOS_i - \overline{MOS})^2} \sqrt{\sum_{i=1}^{N} (MOS_{p,i} - \overline{MOS_p})^2}} $$
